Dear Priya,

I refer to your e-mail of 9 March.

Brisamar rejects the extension of time claimed. The utility has confirmed tha=
t the switchboard upgrade will be completed and the 400A supply energised by =
the end of this week. Tidewell is in any event not ready to commission: the s=
orter is not mechanically complete and, by your own account, work in Bay 3 is=
 incomplete. Any delay to commissioning is the result of Tidewell's late deli=
very in February and its slow progress in Bay 3, not of the power supply.

Brisamar reminds Tidewell that Mechanical Completion is due on 21 March 2025 =
and Practical Completion on 25 April 2025. Brisamar will apply liquidated dam=
ages under clause 10 from 21 March 2025 if Mechanical Completion is not achie=
ved, and reserves all its rights.

Please do not suspend any work. Any suspension will be treated as a breach of=
 the Agreement.

Regards,

Luc=C3=ADa Ortega
Project Director, Brisamar Logistics SA


